<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>{{body.subject}}</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; margin: 20px;
      padding: 20px; background-color: #f8f8f8; } .container { background-color:
      #fff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0,
      0, 0.1); } .status { margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px; border-left: 4px solid
      #007BFF; background-color: #e9f5ff; } .logo-box{ text-align: center; }
      .logo { width: 100px; } .footer { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px;
      color: #777; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='logo-box'>
        <img class='logo' src='{{logoPath}}' alt='' />
      </div>
      <h2>Hi Super Admin, </h2>
      <p>Recently, you have tried importing bulk accounts on our Portal.</p>
      <p>Out of
        {{body.total}}, below
        {{body.failed}}
        users have not been imported successfully due to incomplete information:
      </p>

      <table
        style='border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;'
      >
        <thead style='background-color: #f2f2f2;'>
          <tr>
            <th
              style='border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px; text-align: left;'
            >First Name</th>
            <th
              style='border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px; text-align: left;'
            >Last Name</th>
            <th
              style='border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px; text-align: left;'
            >Email</th>
            <th
              style='border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px; text-align: left;'
            >Phone</th>
            <th
              style='border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px; text-align: left;'
            >Phone Code</th>
            <th
              style='border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px; text-align: left;'
            >Job Title</th>
            <th
              style='border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px; text-align: left;'
            >Location</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {{#each body.failedUsers}}
            <tr>
              <td
                style='border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;'
              >{{firstname}}</td>
              <td
                style='border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;'
              >{{lastname}}</td>
              <td style='border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;'>{{email}}</td>
              <td style='border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;'>{{phone}}</td>
              <td
                style='border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;'
              >{{dial_code}}</td>
              <td
                style='border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;'
              >{{jobtitle}}</td>
              <td
                style='border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;'
              >{{location}}</td>
            </tr>
          {{/each}}
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p>Please create the CSV again for these users by completing the data and
        import again.
      </p>
      <p>Thank you.<br />Base Team</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>